CBACT04C | money | WS-MONTHLY-INT | 96 | COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY-INT = (TRAN-CAT-BAL * DIS-INT-RATE) / 1200, a balance times an annual rate in percent over twelve months; written as TRAN-AMT of a transaction whose TRAN-DESC the program sets to 'Int. for a/c ' (line 484–490). The residual is that a rate (DIS-INT-RATE, also two places) takes part; the dimensional check T-M1 settles that a product of money and a rate is money | D-M2, T-M1 | Fable
